// #897: this used to also import `empty_stmt_array` via a leaf path into
// ../../source_compile/wasi_only/path_utils.vibe -- now that wasi_only/ is
// an index.vpkg boundary, that leaf import is rejected
// (enforce_incoming_boundary_fs, #729), and `empty_stmt_array` is one of
// wasi_only/index.vpkg's deliberately undeclared private helpers (see that
// contract's header). Its body is a one-line forward to this same
// `array_empty[T]()`, already imported below, so the three call sites that
// used `empty_stmt_array()` (building an empty Array[Stmt] accumulator) now
